WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.552
NO SPEAKER makes

00:00:01.364 --> 00:00:02.602
a MacBook trackpad

00:00:02.414 --> 00:00:02.967
talk

00:00:03.486 --> 00:00:05.077
An open-source macOS

00:00:04.889 --> 00:00:05.773
tool drives the

00:00:05.585 --> 00:00:07.082
trackpad's haptic motor

00:00:06.894 --> 00:00:08.026
up to 4,000

00:00:07.837 --> 00:00:08.780
times a second

00:00:08.757 --> 00:00:09.523
so a muted

00:00:09.335 --> 00:00:10.478
MacBook can speak

00:00:10.691 --> 00:00:11.646
sing and play

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:12.247
tones through the

00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:12.731
glass

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.260
A Force Touch

00:00:14.072 --> 00:00:14.838
trackpad

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:16.100
built into MacBooks

00:00:15.911 --> 00:00:17.574
from 2015 on

00:00:17.739 --> 00:00:18.741
or a Magic

00:00:18.553 --> 00:00:19.755
Trackpad 2 or

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:20.145
newer

00:00:20.298 --> 00:00:21.678
and macOS 12

00:00:21.513 --> 00:00:22.444
or later on

00:00:22.256 --> 00:00:23.258
Apple Silicon

00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:24.932
or macOS 13

00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:25.569
or later on

00:00:25.381 --> 00:00:26.041
Intel

00:00:26.558 --> 00:00:28.138
MacBook Pro M5

00:00:27.949 --> 00:00:30.803
Max macOS 27.2.1

00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:31.864
everything works

00:00:32.382 --> 00:00:33.396
Full story on

00:00:33.207 --> 00:00:34.103
the dashboard
